MEMORANDUM
Date:
April 8, 2021
To:
City of Cheyenne, The Honorable Patrick Collins, Mayor
From:
Nathan B anton, Deputy Director of Aviation, Cheyenne Regional Airport
Regarding:
Consideration of Approval for Submittal of an Application for Federal Assistance(FAA
Grant) CYS-NMG-3-56-0005-059-2021 in the amount of $755,000 to perform Runway
Reconstruction Design and Bidding Services and acceptance of the FAA grant in same.
Due to thefact that the Cheyenne Regional Airport Board is a Joint Powers Board comprised of
appointees from both the Cityof Cheyenneand the Countyof Laramie, the Federal Aviation
Administration(FAA)requires that both governing bodies, as wellas the Cheyenne Regional Airport
Board, approve Federal grants for Cheyenne Regional Airport.As such, attached for your review and
consideration for submission and acceptance is a Grant Application from theFAA.Upon approval bythe
FAA, the grant agreement will be distributed for electronic signature to the City of Cheyenne, Countyof
Laramie, and Cheyenne Regional Airport Board.
Summary:
Attached for your review and consideration for approval please find attached an application for Federal
